From 901ff673563c6dbc15dde4b51e1ee1578ff90a77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Feb 2026 11:36:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add real-time WebSocket streaming support (ws command)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add `polymarket ws` command with four subcommands:
- `ws book <asset_ids>` — stream CLOB order book updates
- `ws trades` — stream live trade activity via RTDS
- `ws prices <symbols>` — stream crypto price updates via RTDS
- `ws user` — stream user-specific events (authenticated)

Features auto-reconnect, ping/pong keepalive, table and JSON output,
and graceful Ctrl-C shutdown.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ugwh5T4A9z5jokkHuDvLDe
